1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,562
Smart Vocab - a smart vocabulary notebook built with Google Translate API and Firebase

2
00:00:04,612 --> 00:00:10,257
Step 1: Translate a word using Google Translate API (source language is auto-detected)

3
00:00:10,307 --> 00:00:17,906
It also translates full sentences, e.g. Vietnamese to Japanese

4
00:00:17,956 --> 00:00:33,929
Step 2: Sign in with Firebase Authentication (Email/Password - Google Sign-In is also supported)

5
00:00:33,979 --> 00:00:47,799
Step 3: Save translated words to Cloud Firestore - each user has a private notebook

6
00:00:47,849 --> 00:00:52,705
The notebook updates in realtime via Firestore onSnapshot - data lives at users/{uid}/words

7
00:00:52,755 --> 00:00:57,041
Search words in the notebook

8
00:00:57,091 --> 00:01:10,547
Mark a word as learned, then filter by "Learning" / "Learned"

9
00:01:10,597 --> 00:01:24,418
Step 4: Review with flashcards - click the card to flip and see the meaning

10
00:01:24,468 --> 00:01:38,893
"Learned" / "Not yet" updates the word status and review count in Firestore

11
00:01:38,943 --> 00:01:46,125
Data is stored in the cloud: after reloading the page, the notebook is still there

12
00:01:46,175 --> 00:01:49,626
Sign out - the notebook is private and is hidden when logged out

13
00:01:49,676 --> 00:01:57,600
Live demo: https://smart-vocab-d4665.web.app - Thank you for watching!

